{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":59,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["因罪与主隔绝"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["看啊，耶和华的臂膀并非无力拯救，",{"text":"祂的耳朵并非聋得听不见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是你们的罪过使你们与上帝隔绝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪恶使祂转脸不看你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不听你们的祈求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的手染满了血污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手指沾满了罪恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的嘴唇吐出谎言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舌头嘀咕恶事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人按公义诉讼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人凭诚实申辩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们全凭虚言，谎话连篇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心怀恶意，生出罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们孵毒蛇蛋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人吃了这蛋必死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛋打破后爬出毒蛇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们编蜘蛛网，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这网不能做衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们无法用所制作的遮盖自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们行为邪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做事残暴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的脚奔向邪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"急于滥杀无辜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们心怀恶念，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所到之处，大肆毁灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不知道平安之路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的行径毫无公正；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们走歪门邪道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跟从你们的必不知何为平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，正义远离我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公义临不到我们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们渴望光明，却得到黑暗；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们渴望曙光，却仍然走在幽暗中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们像盲人一样沿墙摸索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像无眼睛的人一样探路。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们在中午也跌跌撞撞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同走在晚上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们在强壮人当中如同死人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们都像熊一样咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如鸽子一般哀鸣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们渴望正义，却得不到；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到拯救，却遥不可及。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我们在上帝面前过犯累累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的罪恶向我们发出控诉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们被过犯缠身，自知有罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们悖逆，否认耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"离弃我们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说欺压、叛逆的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吐露心中编织的谎言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正义被赶逐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公义远远站立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"真理倒在街上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正直被拒之门外。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"真理无处可寻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"远离恶事的人反成了猎物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华见正义荡然无存，感到不悦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂因无人、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无一个人主持公道而惊讶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就用自己的臂膀施行拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用自己的公义维系。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂以公义作铠甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以救恩作头盔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以复仇作衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以热忱作外袍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必按各人的行为报应各人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂的敌人发烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报复祂的仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向众海岛施行报应。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，日落之处的人必敬畏耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日出之地的人必对祂的荣耀肃然起敬。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必如耶和华之气推动的急流一样奔来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“必有一位救赎主来到锡安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到雅各那些离弃罪恶的子孙那里。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和华说：“这是我与他们所立的约：我赐给他们的灵和我放在他们口中的话，必不离开他们和他们的子子孙孙，从现在直到永远。这是耶和华说的。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/59.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/60.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/58.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}